   $ 9 \text{ (short sleeve)} + 27 \text{ (long sleeve)} = 36 \text{ shirts} $

2. **Subtract the number of shirts he washed from the total:**  
   $ 36 \text{ (total)} - 20 \text{ (washed)} = 16 \text{ shirts not washed} $

