$$

Next, we know that 4 puppies are adopted each day. To find out how many days it will take to adopt all 36 puppies, we divide the total number of puppies by the number of puppies adopted per day:
$$
\frac{36 \text{ puppies}}{4 \text{ puppies/day}} = 9 \text{ days}
$$

