Is there any chance that the lyric sheets are included? Wait, the problem says each album came with a lyric sheet and had 9 songs. So the lyric sheets are separate, but they don't affect the number of songs. So even though each album has a lyric sheet, the number of songs is still 9 per album. So the lyric sheets don't add any songs. So the answer is 72. 

